            <div xml:id="d549">

                <pb facs="1302" n="1188" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg1188"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    J.C.S. Files: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Joint Chiefs of Staff to
                        the Commander in Chief, Allied Force Head quarters</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eisenhower</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-08-29">August 29, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6398. Your 
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Naf</hi>
                     342<anchor n="1" xml:id="d549-f1"/> has been seen by the President
                    (book message from the Joint Chiefs of Staff for Eisenhower and USFor for information of British Chiefs of
                    Staff). He authorizes you to proceed with military terms, obtain signature, and
                    then transmit the comprehensive document to the Italian Representatives. The
                    Prime Minister has been informed of this authorization.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d549-f2"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
